<title>JAPAN: Nippon Sanso -6mth parent forecast.</title>
<headline>Nippon Sanso -6mth parent forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			   LATEST	    PREVIOUS	   ACTUAL</p>
<p> (Parent)	     FORECAST	   FORECAST	  YEAR-AGO</p>
<p> Sales		 94.00		94.00		90.16</p>
<p> Current		1.60	     400    million	   1.29</p>
<p> Net		  250    million	 200    million	   1.11</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Sanso Corp is a large oxygen manufacturer.</p>
<p>It said it is likely to post about 1.9 billion yen in special loss in line with a change in accounting rules.</p>
</text>
